        "value": "<h1>[Policy name]</h1><table class=\"pd-doc-plain\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Policy no.</strong></td><td>[POL-000]</td><td><strong>Version</strong></td><td>[1.0]</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Effective</strong></td><td>[Month day, year]</td><td><strong>Owner</strong></td><td>[Department]</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Approved by</strong></td><td>[Name, title]</td><td><strong>Next review</strong></td><td>[Month year]</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>1. Purpose</h2><p>[Why this policy exists and the risk or goal it addresses.]</p><h2>2. Scope</h2><p>[Who and what this policy covers: people, locations, systems, activities. Say what it does not cover.]</p><h2>3. Definitions</h2><ul><li><strong>[Term]</strong> — [meaning in this policy].</li><li><strong>[Term]</strong> — [meaning in this policy].</li></ul><h2>4. Policy</h2><p>4.1 [A rule, stated plainly: who must do what, and when.]</p><p>4.2 [A rule, stated plainly: who must do what, and when.]</p><p>4.3 [A rule, stated plainly: who must do what, and when.]</p><h2>5. Responsibilities</h2><ul><li><strong>[Role]</strong> — [what they are accountable for].</li><li><strong>[Role]</strong> — [what they are accountable for].</li><li><strong>All staff</strong> — [what everyone must do].</li></ul><h2>6. Compliance</h2><p>[How compliance is checked, how to report a breach and what happens when this policy is not followed.]</p><h2>7. Exceptions</h2><p>[Who can approve an exception and how it is recorded.]</p><h2>8. Review</h2><p>This policy is reviewed every [12] months by [owner], or sooner when [law, systems or the organisation] change.</p><h2>Revision history</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Date</th><th>Change</th><th>By</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1.0</td><td>[Date]</td><td>First issue</td><td>[Name]</td></tr></tbody></table>",
